IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `wsha-duties`
IMPORT `wsha-occupier-and-employer`

-- Workplace Safety and Health Act 2006, ss 4(1), 5(1), 10, 11, 12, 14, 14A, 19, 21(2), 59 (with ss 20, 50, 60 from
-- wsha-duties.l4) -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Expected results were written by hand from the text.

