#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `breach of a Part 4 duty` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS 200000
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `breach of a Part 4 duty` FALSE EQUALS 24
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `breach of a Part 4 duty` TRUE EQUALS 0
